flowchart LR
  Editor[Adviser / President / Treasurer / Assistant] --> Record[Record AR or DV]
  Editor --> Support[Edit and link supporting evidence]
  Editor --> OCR[Review OCR drafts]
  Editor --> Retrieve[Filter and retrieve records]
  Auditor --> Retrieve
  Auditor --> Audit[Review version and verify]
  Treasurer --> Delete[Soft delete primary]
  Admin --> Accounts[Manage accounts and roles]
  Admin --> Calendar[Configure calendar / close term]
  Admin --> Archive[Export closed term archive]
  Record --> Guard[Current assignment / open term / valid values]
  Support --> Guard
  Audit --> Guard
  Delete --> Guard
